OL,3,GNEWSACall for action after fall in
OL,4,Anumber of children speaking Welsh
OL,5,
OL,6,FA call has been made for government
OL,7,Faction in establishing Welsh-language
OL,8,Fschools after a fall in the number of
OL,9,Fchildren who can speak the language.
OL,11,FThe annual population survey showed
OL,12,Fthat 275,000 children between 3 and 15
OL,13,Fcould speak Welsh on 31 March 2019,
OL,14,Faccounting for 59%.
OL,16,FBut the figure fell to 48% - 234,300
OL,17,Fspeakers - by 30 June 2026, a reduction
OL,18,Fof 40,700, according to the latest data
OL,19,Fpublished this week.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
