OL,3,GNEWSACall for action after fall in
OL,4,Anumber of children speaking Welsh
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Welsh government said it was
OL,7,Fcommitted to one million Welsh speakers
OL,8,Fby 2050 and would fully implement the
OL,9,FWelsh Language and Education Act to
OL,10,Fhelp every child "become a confident
OL,11,Fand independent Welsh speaker."
